 the Battle of Kursk. The division participated in several engagements towards and after the end of the war, such as the Siege of Budapest and finally the Prague Offensive. The division was disbanded in the summer of 1946.","LocalizedString":"The 845th Rifle Regiment was part of the 303rd Rifle Division during WWII. The division was formed shortly after the German invasion in 1941 and participated in the Yelnya Offensive and later in Operation Typhoon, where the division was destroyed. The division was formed again in 1942, but it wasn’t until 1943 that it saw active combat in the Battle of Kursk. The division participated in several engagements towards and after the end of the war, such as the Siege of Budapest and finally the Prague Offensive. The division was disbanded in the summer of 1946."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Expansion2019","isInPermanentPool":true,"showBoostIcon":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDealDamage"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger"],"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Small'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Small.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/t_rifles_non_ak.t_rifles_non_ak","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Soviet WWII Poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/845th_RIFLES.845th_RIFLES","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":334.0},"historyPhotoSource":"https://ww2db.com/","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_845th_rifles_photo","SourceString":"Soviet troops fighting in Budapest, 1945.","LocalizedString":"Soviet troops fighting in Budapest, 1945."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_845th_rifles_header","SourceString":"Infantry","LocalizedString":"Infantry"},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_Explos